# Area: tab.
# Rationale: AddNewContents must retain the supplied WebContents, BrowserContext,
#   SiteInstance and Chromium opener/noopener/COOP policy instead of recreating
#   a URL-only tab. Establish deliberate synchronous hidden staging before
#   returning; publish opener/disposition creation metadata before observation.
# Last-Rebased: 2026-11-02 (Chromium 156.0.8078.74).
# Audit: verified AddNewContents's pointer return and full argument list in
#   content/public/browser/web_contents_delegate.h; CreateParams::initially_hidden
#   defaults false at this pin. GetBrowserContext/GetOpener/GetWeakPtr/WasHidden
