#   content-supplied user_gesture. Reject NEW_WINDOW, PiP/split, profile changes,
#   non-creation/unknown dispositions and closing sources with was_blocked=true.
#   Accepted paths set it false; preserve Chromium-created contents unchanged
#   apart from delegate/visibility. Popup geometry is not honored while staged;
#   no focus/attachment/window is inferred. URL-only OpenURLFromTab creation
