#   delegate's planned AddNewContents override forwards; its rejection comment
#   is corrected. All other frozen implementations/bridge BUILD.gn untouched.
#   S5 services remain dormant; real profile IDs/transport remain integration work.
# GN: isolated mac :core block. No upstream C++ edits. Sequential full-series
#   reverse/forward replay permits these necessary earlier additive-file edits.
# Gate: build-p17 green attempt 2 (p16: incomplete-type default unique_ptr argument
#   corrected by moving it out of the header). G1-G5 PASS smoke-tab014.log;
#   G3 LC_ALL=C grep -qa PNG; nm adoption/session/registry symbols verified.
